@startuml
title HCP-D07 HCP Connector Health and Stale Projection Flow
skinparam shadowing false

start
:HCP connector checks availability, auth, permissions, and polling;
if (HCP reachable and poll succeeds?) then (yes)
  :Record last successful poll and freshness inputs;
  :Expose operational projection with freshness labels;
else (no)
  :Normalize unavailable / auth failure / timeout / poll failure;
  :Mark projection stale or unavailable as appropriate;
endif
:Report health to Central PMS;
:Display warnings in Operator Console and Management Dashboard where authorized;
if (Continuity evaluation requested?) then (yes)
  :Central PMS applies approved Continuity policy;
  if (fresh and unambiguous under policy?) then (yes)
    :Controlled degraded evaluation may continue;
  else (no)
    :Fail closed or route to supervisor/manual review;
  endif
endif
stop

note right
Health and freshness signals are operational context.
They do not authorize payment, fiscal issuance, discount approval, or exit.
end note
@enduml
